      "writtenOn": "2022-09-24T02:35:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I already have aosp/2216373 which implements part of it : it adds dependency injection to MultinetworkPolicyTracker, though it stops at moving the runAsShell into that method (which may cause flakiness if it\u0027s used concurrently to something else that does it in another thread). It\u0027s a good first step though, and it can be improved by removing completely the dependency on the real DeviceConfig later.\n\nReally what I would like is to petition the owners of DeviceConfig to make it more testable...\n\nImmediately, since dependency injection is added in a followup, I think I want to leave this as it is in this patch, especially considering how big adding the dependency injection is.",
      "parentUuid": "951c544b_fd2bac64",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5810,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 5810,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "cd3ccf709b1aabfc46c131b83b94b4110e142bd7",
