      "message": "An assumption would be good here. Something like:\n\n    @Test\n    public void testPreferBadWifi_DoPrefer() throws Exception {\n        runAsShell(READ_DEVICE_CONFIG, () -\u003e doTestPreferBadWifi(true));\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    public void testPreferBadWifi_DoNotPrefer() throws Exception {\n        // Starting with U this mode is no longer supported\n        assumeFalse(SdkLevel.isAtLeastU());\n        runAsShell(READ_DEVICE_CONFIG, () -\u003e doTestPreferBadWifi(false));\n    }",
